schema_consistency_rules = """
Schema consistency rules:
- Always return every top-level field in the extraction schema.
- Use null for unavailable scalar values.
- Use [] for unavailable list values.
- Never place empty placeholder objects inside arrays.
- previous_glp1, current_glp1 and reason_for_switch must always be arrays of strings.
- Use an empty array when no GLP-1 switch occurred.
- treatment_event must be one object, not an array.
- baseline_conditions, desired_effects, adverse_effects,
